# G1 (STOP): the card re-test of the SHIP image (tp4-ship-1, the exact base the production layer is built on), unaudited (an audited 8x262k profile costs about 8.4 minutes per
# request). The ship profile with W2 and engine reuse TOGETHER in one process for the first time: warmup, a coding answer, eight-seat steady and skew (the deadline rule: slowest
# first token under 238 s), the five Lever N hang shapes, the drain, an abort and reuse of a parked slot, then the 40 agent turns of parked_turns. RUN WITH THE CI PAUSED (the skew
# is timed: v603 read 257.9 s under CI load). READ (c2_smoke_check, every rule clean, including the smoke's concurrent8_steady list rule): '[QWEN-C2] profile
# c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic: OWNER TRAFFIC WAIVER', 'lever N governor: ttft=180 gap_floor=8', the tp4 sdpa engaged line config=multi flags=0x21 and the
# multi UNQUALIFIED line (expected at 262,144), the conv-gates spread engaged line, the parked build of 8 engines and every rebind clean (0 refused, failed, fallbacks or width
# mismatches), no stall, 0 crashes, skew under 238 s, the DRAM-after-attach lines (record the free DRAM per chip: engine reuse and W2 together were never measured).
# Measured basis: v567 24 minutes (hang shapes, steady, skew), v610 16 (parked hang shapes), v612 8 (parked turns).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_skew,levern_decoder_finishes,levern_all_decoders_finish,levern_cancel_mid_prefill,levern_arrival_during_prefill,levern_seed_stops,concurrent8_drain,parked_abort_reuse,parked_turns
C2_BOX_MINUTES=75
